  "ruleText": "Saf-C 902.06 “Driver” means “driver” of a commercial motor vehicle as defined in 49 CFR 390.5.\n\nSource. #8404, eff 8-2-05 (from Saf-C 901.03); ss by #10215, eff 10-25-12; ss by #13684, eff 7-17-23",
